"view.transitscreen.help"               = "Enigma calculates transits for the most recently selected horoscope. If multiple horoscopes are active, you can make a different choice.\n\nTo calculate a transit, you must select an event. If needed, you can create a new event.\n\nClick the 'Calculate' button and you will see the transits in the middle part of the screen. To calculate transits for a different event, choose a different event and click 'Calculate' again.";
