// TransitResults (results screen)
"view.transitresults.help"                     = "The information shown in this screen depends on your configuration. This includes both the choice of factors in the radix and the factors you want to use for transits.\n\nYou see four tabs.\n\nThe 'Positions' tab shows an overview of the transit positions, both in longitude and declination.\n\nThe 'Midpoints' tab shows an overview of both the transit planet relative to midpoints in the radix, and an overview of transit-formed midpoints where a radix planet is located.\n\nThe 'Aspects' tab shows which transits form an aspect with a point in the radix. You also see the orb and the exactness of the aspect.\n\nThe 'Dual Wheel' tab shows the horoscope with the transit positions in an extra ring.";
"view.transitresults.title"                    = "Transit Positions";
"view.transitresults.noresults"                = "Select an event and press Calculate to see positions.";
